  "ruleText": "Rev 3401.19 “Thousand board feet (MBF)” means the number of board feet of saw logs expressed in thousands or a fraction thereof.\n\nSource. #10664, eff 9-4-14; ss by #14026, eff 7-16-24 (formerly Rev 3401.07)",
